# Dwarpal's Helm chart (Phase 8, ADR-0015): the same services as the one-server Compose file, for a Kubernetes cluster.
# The single server stays the plan; this is the artefact for whoever outgrows it.
apiVersion: v2
name: dwarpal
description: Private age checks — the API, the inference service, the web app and the demo shop
type: application
# The chart's own version, and the version of Dwarpal it installs by default (an image tag).
version: 0.1.0
appVersion: "latest"
